cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: tg-analysis
abstract: >-
  A Python package for thermogravimetric (TGA) signal denoising with
  Savitzky-Golay smoothing (residual-whiteness window selection),
  mass-loss event detection, five candidate mass-loss estimators
  (endpoint subtraction, ICTAC sloped tangent, and three DTG-area
  baseline modes: constant, linear-blend, alpha-blend), and
  Frazer-Suzuki peak deconvolution of overlapping decomposition events.
type: software
version: 0.1.1
date-released: "2026-07-24"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.21144539"
license: MIT
